---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="openspec" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">
      {t(
        "Pottery workshop · illustrated specification delta",
        "도예 수업 · 명세 변경 차이 예시",
        "陶芸教室 · 仕様差分の例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Preserve the rule. Review the addition.",
        "기존 규칙 보존, 추가 내용 검토",
        "既存ルールを保ち、追加を確認",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="changes">
    <article class="current" data-current-spec>
      <h3>{t("Current specification", "현재 명세", "現在の仕様")}</h3>
      <p class="kept">
        ={" "}
        {t(
          "Every booking receives confirmation",
          "모든 예약에 확인 제공",
          "全ての予約に確認を送る",
        )}
      </p>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Existing behavior stays in scope for checks",
          "기존 동작도 점검 범위에 포함",
          "既存の動作も確認の対象",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="delta" data-proposed-delta>
      <h3>{t("Proposed change", "제안한 변경", "提案する変更")}</h3>
      <p class="added">
        +{" "}
        {t(
          "Reschedule at least 24 hours before class",
          "수업 시작 24시간 전까지 일정 변경",
          "授業の24時間前まで日程変更",
        )}
      </p>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Example’s agreed threshold; review the boundary",
          "예시에서 합의한 기준·시간 경계 검토",
          "例で合意した条件・時間境界を確認",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="review" data-change-review>
    <b>
      {t(
        "Review → implement → check both behaviors",
        "검토 → 구현 → 두 동작 점검",
        "確認 → 実装 → 両方の動作を検証",
      )}
    </b>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Proposal + specification delta + design + tasks",
        "제안 + 명세 차이 + 설계 + 작업",
        "提案 + 仕様差分 + 設計 + 作業",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="result" data-sync-archive>
    <div>
      <h3>{t("Reconciled specification", "일치시킨 명세", "整合した仕様")}</h3>
      <p>
        = {t("Confirmation preserved", "확인 규칙 보존", "確認ルールを維持")}
      </p>
      <p>+ {t("Rescheduling added", "일정 변경 추가", "日程変更を追加")}</p>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <h3>{t("Archived change", "보관한 변경 기록", "保存した変更記録")}</h3>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Keep the decision and its rationale",
          "결정과 이유 보존",
          "判断と理由を保つ",
        )}
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Archiving does not prove correct behavior. Keep specifications and code aligned; setup and artifact maintenance must be worthwhile.",
      "보관만으로 올바른 동작이 증명되지는 않습니다. 명세와 코드를 일치시키며 설치·기록 유지 비용을 검토합니다.",
      "保存だけで正しい動作は証明できません。仕様とコードを一致させ、導入・記録維持の費用を検討します。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 34px);
    background: #edf3fa;
    color: #263956;
    border: 1px solid #92a5bd;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h2,
  h3 {
    color: inherit;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .changes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  article {
    padding: 20px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .current {
    border: 1px solid #92a5bd;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .delta {
    border: 2px dashed #425f88;
    background: #e1ebfa;
  }
  .kept,
  .added {
    margin: 18px 0 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  article > p:last-child {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  .review {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-block: 1px solid #92a5bd;
  }
  .review p {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  .result {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .result > div {
    border-left: 5px solid #425f88;
    padding-left: 14px;
  }
  .result p {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  aside {
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 1px solid #92a5bd;
  }
  .boundary {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 570px) {
    .changes,
    .result {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    article {
      padding: 16px;
    }
    aside {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #92a5bd;
      padding: 16px 0 0;
    }
  }
</style>
